  body: "# DLA care and mobility components\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe source identifies separate DLA
    care and mobility components, allowing one or both, and relates the disability questions to functional care
    and mobility needs.\n\n## Scope and exceptions\n\nThe illustrative child example on page 4 concerns needs despite
    absence of a diagnosis; it is not an individual assessment rule. Age, residence, component-specific criteria,
    transitions to other benefits and devolved schemes require separate review. DLA and PIP are not made equivalent.\n\
    \n## Inspected passages\n\n- [DMG 61008, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=3).\n\
    - [DMG 61009, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 61011, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [DMG 61012, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=4).\n\
    \n## Additional context\n\n- [Context: chapter 61, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=4).\n\
    - [Context: chapter 61, PDF page 5](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=5).\n\
    \n## Evidence and review status\n\nIndependent experimental interpretation of captured DWP guidance, not an
    official DWP document. Definitions and semantic associations are model-assisted proposals awaiting specialist
    review. No individual entitlement decision, medical conclusion, award calculation or executable rule is provided.\n\
    \nSource observation, listing-page update, printed revision, legal event and claimant-event dates are separate.
    Current legal applicability is unresolved. Page numbers are one-based PDF positions; machine extraction may
    damage reading order, characters and footnotes. No visual PDF or specialist acceptance is claimed.\n\n- `dmg-vol10-ch61`:
    PDF `884dc79907770bd9e178fe4122c0b7d404697f4ccc882b067e9220b34a0f002a`; extracted pages `23b4405d725de2fde124df29a8c753b9fcb7530405c83d588bd321e1e83226cc`;
    acquired `2026-09-15T19:45:32.783276Z`.\n"
  resource: https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695ba618295a95414df21af4/dmg-ch-61.pdf#page=3
