    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: Individual effects and evidence, rather than generic assumptions from a medical condition,
      guide requests for medical advice.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol10-ch61/0008
      quote: "61027 The questions should refer specifically to the effects of the medical conditions in each individual\n\
        case. General inquiries about disability needs arising from a particular medical condition should be\navoided
        where possible. General advice may not always be relevant and may be misleading.\n\n\n\nExamination and
        report"
      locator: DMG 61027
